The research follows a sequential process beginning with proposal development and
literature review, followed by proposal presentation and system design. Subsequent
stages include dataset collection and preparation, prompt design and implementation,
prototype development, testing, evaluation, data analysis, and final report writing. This
structured workflow ensures systematic development and evaluation of the proposed
interview coaching system.
